<h1>Wheelhouse password reset</h1>

<p>We received a request to reset the password for your Wheelhouse account.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Reset your password", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %></p>

<p>This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.</p>

<p>If you did not request a password reset, you can ignore this email.</p>